1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,258
STA | Stock Token Agent

2
00:00:02,258 --> 00:00:06,452
Start with a budget and an investment goal.

3
00:00:06,452 --> 00:00:11,613
2 USDC. A 5% annual target. At least 50% in cash.

4
00:00:11,613 --> 00:00:16,129
The agent tests strategies against the requested risk limits.

5
00:00:16,129 --> 00:00:20,645
Compare historical performance after trading costs.

6
00:00:20,645 --> 00:00:25,806
Review the candidates before approving an allocation.

7
00:00:25,806 --> 00:00:30,323
Choose the strategy and connect the agent wallet.

8
00:00:30,323 --> 00:00:38,065
The user signs the strategy approval in their wallet.

9
00:00:38,065 --> 00:00:43,226
The approval is recorded on Solana devnet.

10
00:00:43,226 --> 00:00:48,387
Start the allocation. The agent handles the approved trades.

11
00:00:48,387 --> 00:00:52,903
The submitted order is waiting for confirmation.

12
00:00:52,903 --> 00:00:56,129
Inspect the on-chain verification record.

13
00:00:56,129 --> 00:01:01,290
JNJ is settled. The receipt and updated holdings are visible.

14
00:01:01,290 --> 00:01:07,742
Create another strategy without closing the first.

15
00:01:07,742 --> 00:01:14,194
Describe the next investment in natural language.

16
00:01:14,194 --> 00:01:20,645
This request is in Korean: 1 USDC, targeting 3% over one year.

17
00:01:20,645 --> 00:01:27,097
Keep a cash reserve and set a maximum drawdown.

18
00:01:27,097 --> 00:01:32,903
The new request becomes a separate research plan.

19
00:01:32,903 --> 00:01:38,710
The agent backtests another set of candidate strategies.

20
00:01:38,710 --> 00:01:44,516
Review returns, drawdown and trading costs together.

21
00:01:44,516 --> 00:01:49,677
Approve the second allocation and review its stock purchases.

22
00:01:49,677 --> 00:01:54,194
Sign this strategy approval in the wallet.

23
00:01:54,194 --> 00:01:58,710
Record the approval, then start the new allocation.

24
00:01:58,710 --> 00:02:03,871
The agent begins execution under the second approved plan.

25
00:02:03,871 --> 00:02:07,097
Track the purchase as it moves toward confirmation.

26
00:02:07,097 --> 00:02:11,613
Devnet verification and mainnet execution have separate receipts.

27
00:02:11,613 --> 00:02:18,710
JNJ settles; the next order is tracked separately.

28
00:02:18,710 --> 00:02:25,161
Now test an unrealistic target.

29
00:02:25,161 --> 00:02:32,903
1 USDC. A 1,000% return in 30 days. Maximum loss: 1%.

30
00:02:32,903 --> 00:02:39,355
The agent evaluates the request instead of promising a return.

31
00:02:39,355 --> 00:02:45,806
Backtests check whether any strategy satisfies those limits.

32
00:02:45,806 --> 00:02:50,968
Target not supported. The tested strategies do not qualify.

33
00:02:50,968 --> 00:02:56,363
No new trade is approved. The evidence explains why.
